      <p>
        <strong>Full Names:</strong> Hong Kong Time (HKT) / Singapore Time (SGT) / Japan Standard Time (JST) / Korea Standard Time (KST)  
        <br /><strong>Offsets:</strong> HKT (UTC+8), SGT (UTC+8), JST (UTC+9), KST (UTC+9)  
        <br /><strong>Major Cities:</strong> Hong Kong, Singapore, Tokyo, Seoul.  
        <br /><strong>Usage Note:</strong> These East Asian time zones are observed year-round with no Daylight Saving Time changes.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- HST -->
    <article class="method-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3>HST</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>Full Name:</strong> Hawaii Standard Time  
        <br /><strong>Offset:</strong> UTC-10 year-round (No DST)  
        <br /><strong>Major Cities:</strong> Honolulu, Hilo, Lahaina.  
        <br /><strong>Usage Note:</strong> Observed across Hawaii and parts of French Polynesia.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- ICT / WIB / WITA / WIT -->
    <article class="method-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3>ICT, WIB, WITA &amp; WIT</h3>
