        <br /><strong>Offsets:</strong> ICT (UTC+7), WIB (UTC+7), WITA (UTC+8), WIT (UTC+9)  
        <br /><strong>Major Cities:</strong> Bangkok (ICT), Jakarta (WIB), Denpasar (WITA), Jayapura (WIT).  
        <br /><strong>Usage Note:</strong> Observed year-round in Southeast Asia and Indonesia.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- IRST / IRDT -->
    <article class="method-card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h3>IRST &amp; IRDT</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>Full Names:</strong> Iran Standard Time (IRST) / Iran Daylight Time (IRDT)  
        <br /><strong>Winter Offset:</strong> UTC+3:30  
        <br /><strong>Summer Offset:</strong> UTC+4:30  
        <br /><strong>Major Cities:</strong> Tehran, Mashhad, Isfahan.  
        <br /><strong>Usage Note:</strong> Iran abolished Daylight Saving Time in September 2022, and now observes UTC+3:30 year-round.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- IST -->
