        <br /><strong>Winter Offset:</strong> UTC-7  
        <br /><strong>Summer Offset:</strong> UTC-6  
        <br /><strong>Major Cities:</strong> Denver, Salt Lake City, Calgary, Edmonton, Phoenix.  
        <br /><strong>Usage Note:</strong> Arizona (except for the Navajo Nation) remains on MST (UTC-7) year-round and does not observe MDT.
