        <br /><strong>Summer Offset:</strong> UTC-2:30  
        <br /><strong>Major Cities:</strong> St. John's, Corner Brook, Gander.  
        <br /><strong>Usage Note:</strong> Observed in the province of Newfoundland and Labrador in eastern Canada.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- NZST / NZDT -->
